tion":"Farms are essential to increase your empire, cause they provide you food. Go to the build menu and place a farm.","hint":"","id":6,"reward":10,"title":"Build another Farm"},{"description":"People live in houses! The more houses you build, the more units you can train. You can see the current population limit at the top right corner.","hint":"","id":7,"reward":10,"title":"Build another House"},{"description":"Prepare for the battle! You need an army. Click on the 'Build' button, select the 'Attack' category and finally click on the Barracks building.","hint":"","id":8,"reward":10,"title":"Build a barracks"},{"description":"Start building your army with spearmen. Click on the barracks building, the bottom panel will appear, search the 'train spearman' button and click on it. Repeat this 3 times.","hint":"","id":9,"reward":10,"title":"Train 3 spearmen"},{"description":"Mill will provide you some food, like farms. Build one using the build menu!","hint":"","id":10,"reward":10,"title":"Build a mill"},{"description":"Mills don't work alone! They need villagers. Select a villager and click on the mill.","hint":"","id":11,"reward":10,"title":"Bring a villager to the mill"},{"description":"Gold will make you more powerful! It is used to train the best units. Select a villager and click on a gold vein  (Explore the map to find gold veins)","hint":"","id":12,"reward":10,"title":"Extract 3 of gold"},{"description":"Let's have some fun! Pick your army with the 'square' button, find some trolls near your empire and click on them to start the battle.","hint":"","id":13,"reward":10,"title":"Kill 3 trolls"},{"description":"Sheeps are funny! But they need a sheep ranch! Build one using the build menu. It will provide you some food!","hint":"","id":14,"reward":10,"title":"Build a sheep ranch"},{"description":"Ok! If you already got a sheep ranch, now go for some sheeps. Select a villager and click on a sheep to capture it.","hint":"","id":15,"reward":10,"title":"Capture a sheep"},{"description":"You own a sheep! It will go where you want. Select it and send it to the ranch.","hint":"","id":16,"reward":10,"title":"Bring a sheep to the ranch"},{"description":"When a sheep ranch is ready to collect (you will notice the icon), click on it!","hint":"","id":17,"reward":10,"title":"Collect a sheep ranch"},{"description":"With one farm you will not conquer the world! Build 5 of them.","hint":"","id":18,"reward":10,"title":"Build 5 farms"},{"description":"Build 8 houses to increase your population limit.","hint":"","id":19,"reward":10,"title":"Build 8 houses"},{"description":"Gold can also be obtained from gold mines, buy you can only own one. Build it!","hint":"","id":20,"reward":10,"title":"Build 1 gold mine"},{"description":"Gold mines need villagers to extract the gold. Bring one of them to the mine.","hint":"","id":21,"reward":10,"title":"Put 1 villager into the mine"},{"description":"An archery will allow you to train archer infantry. Archers have a longer range than normal infantry.","hint":"","id":22,"reward":10,"title":"Build an archery"},{"description":"Train 3 light archers at your archery! Remember, click the archery an then click the train light archer button at the bottom.","hint":"","id":23,"reward":10,"title":"Train 3 light archers"},{"description":"It's time to kill trolls! Meet your army and go for trolls. These creatures are not good for your empire!","hint":"","id":24,"reward":10,"title":"Kill 5 trolls"},{"description":"Click one of your friends at the bottom to see his/her empire! Is it bigger than yours?","hint":"","id":25,"reward":10,"title":"Visit 1 friend's empire"},{"description":"Your enemy has an encampment at the outskirts. Find it an destroy one of his buildings!","hint":"","id":26,"reward":10,"title":"Destroy an enemy building"},{"description":"Your army needs cavalry! Build an stable to train light knights","hint":"","id":27,"reward":10,"title":"Build an stable"},{"description":"Its not all about battling! Put some decorations to your empire to make it happier!","hint":"","id":28,"reward":10,"title":"Build 5 decorations"},{"description":"You can move multiple units at once! Make double click on a unit to select more than one!","hint":"","id":29,"reward":10,"title":"Move multiple units at once"},{"description":"Troll hunting time! Do I have to tell you again?","hint":"","id":30,"reward":10,"title":"Kill 7 trolls"},{"description":"Every empire has a name! Put a name to your empire. Click at your park name at the top right corner.","hint":"","id":31,"reward":10,"title":"Put a name to your Empire"},{"description":"Find 10 trees and collect them!","hint":"","id":32,"reward":10,"title":"Harvest 10 trees"},{"description":"Cows also give you food! Use your villagers to capture them. Once captured, they will obey your orders!","hint":"","id":33,"reward":10,"title":"Capture a cow"},{"description":"Build a cow ranch to hold your cows.","hint":"","id":34,"reward":10,"title":"Build a cow ranch"},{"description":"Bring a cow into a ranch. TIP: To extract a cow from a ranch, select the ranch and click the cow on the bottom panel.","hint":"","id":35,"reward":10,"title":"Bring a cow to the ranch"},{"description":"Collect 5 farms. TIP: You can put more than one villager into a farm. The more villagers, the more resources it will provide.","hint":"","id":36,"reward":10,"title":"Collect 5 farms"},{"description":"Populations makes you bigger. Reach 25 population. Remember to build enough houses!","hint":"","id":37,"reward":10,"title":"Reach 25 population"},{"description":"Go for some gold! But be carefull with the trolls!","hint":"","id":38,"reward":10,"title":"Harvest 10 gold veins"},{"description":"Party time! Pick your army and finish with some trolls!","hint":"","id":39,"reward":10,"title":"Kill 10 trolls"},{"description":"Prepare you army... Your mission is to destroy 5 enemy buildings! Make sure you have enough units!","hint":"","id":40,"reward":10,"title":"Destory 5 enemy buildings"},{"description":"When you finish with all the trolls you can steal its treasure!","hint":"","id":41,"reward":10,"title":"Obtain Troll's Treasure"},{"description":"Use your villagers to harvest 5 stone groups!","hint":"","id":42,"reward":10,"title":"Extract 10 of stone"},{"description":"Out of space? Don't worry, you can buy extra space! Click on the \"Click to buy\" sign to buy an adjacent area.","hint":"","id":43,"reward":10,"title":"Expand to 2 acres"},{"description":"Go for wood! Cut 15 trees and collect its wood.","hint":"","id":44,"reward":10,"title":"Harvest 15 trees"},{"description":"You need more farms, buy 10 farms!","hint":"","id":45,"reward":10,"title":"Build 10 farms"},{"description":"Reach 40 population. Your empire looks good!","hint":"","id":46,"reward":10,"title":"Reach 40 population"},{"description":"Remember to capture the cows! Use your villagers buy protect them with your army!","hint":"","id":47,"reward":10,"title":"Capture 3 cows"},{"description":"Make some noise! This time you must kill 20 trolls.","hint":"","id":48,"reward":10,"title":"Kill 20 trolls"},{"description":"Harvesting time. Find 10 gold veins!","hint":"","id":49,"reward":10,"title":"Extract 15 of gold"},{"description":"Destroy 15 enemy buildings. Make sure to create a strong army!","hint":"","id":50,"reward":10,"title":"Destroy 15 enemy buildings"},{"description":"Fins 3 sheeps for your ranches!","hint":"","id":51,"reward":10,"title":"Capture 3 sheeps"},{"description":"Find 10 stone veins and harvest them.","hint":"","id":52,"reward":10,"title":"Extract 15 of stone"},{"description":"Space is power! Buy a third expansion.","hint":"","id":53,"reward":10,"title":"Expand to 3 acres"},{"description":"Wonders are the most valuable buildings you can own. They will give you great ammounts of resources!","hint":"","id":54,"reward":10,"title":"Build a wonder"},{"description":"Wood is a vital resource. Harvest 20 trees!","hint":"","id":55,"reward":10,"title":"Harvest 20 trees"},{"description":"Visit 3 friend's empires!","hint":"","id":56,"reward":10,"title":"Visit 3 friends"},{"description":"More farms means more food! Build 20 farms!","hint":"","id":57,"reward":10,"title":"Build 20 farms"},{"description":"Your empire needs more people. Reach 75!","hint":"","id":58,"reward":10,"title":"Reach 75 population"},{"description":"Without meat, your army will not survive! Capture 5 cows!","hint":"","id":59,"reward":10,"title":"Capture 5 cows"},{"description":"Do you want to have a good time? Kill 35 trolls! Your army will enjoy!","hint":"","id":60,"reward":10,"title":"Kill 35 trolls"},{"description":"Find 20 gold veins before trolls find it!","hint":"","id":61,"reward":10,"title":"Extract 18 of gold"},{"description":"Prepare your army to destroy 30 enemy buildings!","hint":"","id":62,"reward":10,"title":"Destroy 30 enemy buildings"},{"description":"Find 5 sheeps and bring them to the ranch!","hint":"","id":63,"reward":10,"title":"Capture 5 sheeps"},{"description":"You need a lot of stone! Find 20 groups of stone.","hint":"","id":64,"reward":10,"title":"Extract 18 of stone"},{"description":"Buy your 4rth expansion!","hint":"","id":65,"reward":10,"title":"Expand to 4 acres"},{"description":"Build a second wonder!","hint":"","id":66,"reward":10,"title":"Build 2 wonders"},{"description":"Prepare your villages to collect wood! Harvest 50 trees.","hint":"","id":67,"reward":10,"title":"Harvest 50 trees"},{"description":"Chose your 5 best friends and visit their empires","hint":"","id":68,"reward":10,"title":"Visit 5 friend's empires"},{"description":"Really, farms are important... Build 50!","hint":"","id":69,"reward":10,"title":"Build 50 farms"},{"description":"Time to become bigger. Reach 100 population.","hint":"","id":70,"reward":10,"title":"Reach 100 population"},{"description":"Find 7 cows and your army will be very happy!","hint":"","id":71,"reward":10,"title":"Capture 7 Cows"},{"description":"This is what you were waiting for, weren't you? Kill 50 trolls!","hint":"","id":72,"reward":10,"title":"Kill 50 trolls"},{"description":"I know you like gold, so harvest 50 gold!","hint":"","id":73,"reward":10,"title":"Extract 20 of gold"},{"description":"Find and blow up 50 enemy buildings!","hint":"","id":74,"reward":10,"title":"Destroy 50 enemy buildings"},{"description":"Capture 7 sheeps for your empire!","hint":"","id":75,"reward":10,"title":"Capture 7 sheeps"},{"description":"Build a blacksmith. The blacksmith will give you gold regularly.","hint":"","id":76,"reward":10,"title":"Build a blacksmith"},{"description":"Did I told you that you need a lot of stone? Harvest 50 stone groups.","hint":"","id":77,"reward":10,"title":"Extract 20 of stone"},{"description":"Buy your 6th expansion!","hint":"","id":78,"reward":10,"title":"Expand to 6 acres"},{"description":"Build your 3rd wonder.","hint":"","id":79,"reward":10,"title":"Build 3 wonders"},{"description":"Easy. Harvest 100 trees.","hint":"","id":80,"reward":10,"title":"Harvest 100 trees"},{"description":"The market is a special building that allow you to exchange buy and sell resources. Build one!","hint":"","id":81,"reward":10,"title":"Build a market"},{"description":"Select the market and click the market button at the bottom. Then, trade some resources.","hint":"","id":82,"reward":10,"title":"Trade resources (market)"},{"description":"Visit 10 friends! You have 10 friends, haven't you?","hint":"","id":83,"reward":10,"title":"Visit 10 friend's empire"},{"description":"I'm sure you don't have enough farms, build 100 of them!","hint":"","id":84,"reward":10,"title":"Build 100 farms"},{"description":"An empire without 150 people is not an empire!","hint":"","id":85,"reward":10,"title":"Reach 150 population"},{"description":"Ok ok, wake up your army! They must kill 75 trolls!","hint":"","id":86,"reward":10,"title":"Kill 75 trolls"},{"description":"Finish with 75 enemy buildings.","hint":"","id":87,"reward":10,"title":"Destroy 75 enemy buildings"},{"description":"Universities give lots of money! Build one.","hint":"","id":88,"reward":10,"title":"Build a university"},{"description":"Do you want to be the biggest? You need 9 acres!","hint":"","id":89,"reward":10,"title":"Expand to 9 acres"},{"description":"Build 5 wonders","hint":"","id":90,"reward":10,"title":"Build 5 wonders"},{"description":"Is your empire the best of facebook? Visit your friends to discover it!","hint":"","id":91,"reward":10,"title":"Visit 25 friend's empire"},{"description":"A farm will provide food to your empire. Go to the build menu and place a farm near your townhall!","hint":"","id":1,"reward":10,"title":"Build a farm"}],"images":{"/chapters/chapter_1.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_10.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_10_m.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_10_old.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_10_w.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_11.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_11_m.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_11_old.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_11_w.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_12.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_12_m.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_12_w.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_1_m.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_1_w.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_2.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_2_m.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_2_w.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_3.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_3_m.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_3_w.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_4.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_4_m.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_4_w.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_5.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_5_m.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_5_old.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_5_w.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_6.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_6_m.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_6_old.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_6_w.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_7.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_7_m.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_7_old.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_7_w.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_8.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_8_m.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_8_w.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_9.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_9_m.jpg":"en","/chapters/chapter_9_w.jpg":"en","/chapters/simple/alie